[MEAS] the conjunct, lifted from :275: theFixCommit.length > 8

# arm → the value the key resolves to → the conjunct's truth
[MEAS] true   5ae6cdc2 round397: S3b's prose asserted the cured state a…
         arm: NO-CRIPPLE (live: log -1 on the path)
[MEAS] true   4a2fccf5 round395: his 394 reproduces in three trees, and…
         arm: KP (the add event — a DIFFERENT, correct commit)
[MEAS] true   6935ce02 Initial commit: Steps 1-3 of Klatch
         arm: KP (the repo root commit — maximally wrong, still a real commit)
[MEAS] false  (empty)
